TO SHADES
    OUTPUT [PINKS REDS YELLOWS BROWNS GREENS CYANS BLUES PURPLES WHITES GRAYS]
END

TO SHADE
    OUTPUT [PINK RED YELLOW BROWN GREEN CYAN BLUE PURPLE WHITE GRAY]
END

