TO DARKS
    OUTPUT [DARKBLUE DARKCYAN DARKGOLDENROD DARKGRAY DARKGREEN DARKKHAKI DARKMAGENTA DARKOLIVEGREEN DARKORANGE DARKORCHID DARKRED DARKSALMON DARKSEAGREEN DARKSLATEBLUE DARKSLATEGRAY DARKTURQUOISE DARKVIOLET]
