    OUTPUT [105 106 107 108]
END

BURY [COLORSN COLORSI COLORSIN COLORSG COLORSGN SHADE SHADEN SHADES INTENSITY INTENSITIES]
FOREACH SHADES [BURY "? BURY WORD "? "N]
FOREACH INTENSITY [BURY WORD "? "S BURY WORD "? "SN]
